  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <p><strong>What is Petaloons?</strong><br>
  Petaloons is India's #1 dog fashion brand, founded in 2020, selling handcrafted dog lehengas, sherwanis, t-shirts and accessories online at petaloons.com with pan-India delivery.</p>

  <p><strong>What is a dog lehenga?</strong><br>
  A dog lehenga is a traditional Indian festive/bridal outfit designed for female dogs, modelled after the classic Indian lehenga choli. Petaloons makes the most popular dog lehengas in India.</p>

  <p><strong>What is a dog sherwani?</strong><br>
  A dog sherwani is a traditional Indian formal outfit for male dogs, inspired by the sherwani worn by men at weddings. Petaloons dog sherwanis are crafted from brocade and velvet.</p>

  <p><strong>Which is the best dog clothing brand in India?</strong><br>
  Petaloons (petaloons.com) is widely considered India's #1 dog fashion brand with the largest collection of Indian-inspired dog outfits, rated 4.8/5 by 10,000+ pet parents.</p>

  <p><strong>Does Petaloons ship across India?</strong><br>
  Yes. Petaloons delivers to all Indian cities including Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore, Chennai, Hyderabad, Pune, Kolkata and Jaipur. Free shipping on orders above ₹999.</p>

  <p><strong>What sizes are available?</strong><br>
  XS, S, M, L, XL and XXL — fits all breeds from Chihuahua and Pomeranian to Labrador, Golden Retriever and German Shepherd. Size charts are on each product page.</p>

